@startuml

title ComponentHub - Forgot Password and Reset

actor User
participant "Reset page\n(forgot-password.js)" as UI
participant "Express API" as API
participant "Email service\n(Resend)" as Mail
database "SQLite" as DB

User -> UI: Enter registered email
UI -> UI: Validate email format
UI -> API: POST /api/auth/forgot-password
API -> DB: Find account and create reset token/OTP
API -> Mail: Send password-reset OTP
API --> UI: Reset token and generic message
UI -> User: Display OTP and new-password step

User -> UI: Enter OTP and new password
UI -> UI: Validate OTP and password confirmation
UI -> API: POST /api/auth/reset-password
API -> DB: Load reset request
API -> API: Check expiry, attempts and OTP hash
alt Invalid, expired or weak reset request
  API --> UI: Error response
  UI --> User: Show reset error
else Valid reset request
  API -> DB: Update password hash\nDelete reset request
  API --> UI: Password reset successfully
  UI -> User: Redirect to login
end

opt Resend OTP
  User -> UI: Request replacement OTP
  UI -> API: POST /api/auth/forgot-password/resend
  API -> Mail: Send replacement OTP
  API -> DB: Replace OTP hash and expiry
  API --> UI: Resend confirmation
end
@enduml
